Error [E0068]: this callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/E0405_refutable_test_bind_route_must_diverge.jet:1:16
    |
  1 | fn parse_age() => Int String! {
    |                ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0068

Error [E0405]: `??` must diverge after a refutable binding
  --> tests/ui/E0405_refutable_test_bind_route_must_diverge.jet:6:32
    |
  6 |     parse_age() == .Ok(age) ?? 0
    |                                ^
 Why: a failed pattern match cannot continue without defining the captures
 Fix: use `return`, `panic(...)`, `break`, or `next` as the fallback
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0405
